# Goal state (example — copy to `.agents/GOAL.md` for an active run)

> Active `.agents/GOAL.md` is gitignored. Commit this example only.
> Detail briefs live in `GOAL_BRIEF.md` (repo root) or `.agents/sessions/`. This file tracks state and turn accountability.

## Active goal

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| **Condition** | _(measurable end state: what must be true when done)_ |
| **Proof** | _(exact commands that must exit 0; list substrate/prereq checks first, then E2E/gates)_ |
| **Constraints** | _(paths that must not change, conventions, operator-only steps to report instead of attempt)_ |
| **Bound** | _(optional: stop after N turns, or token budget)_ |
| **Started** | YYYY-MM-DD |
| **Status** | `active` |

## Turn log

| Turn | Work summary | Proof run | Verdict | Reason |
|------|--------------|-----------|---------|--------|
| 1 | _(what was done this turn)_ | _(commands run + result)_ | NOT MET | _(why the goal is not yet met)_ |

## Achieved (session)

_(Append a short summary only after every proof above passes; then clear the Active goal.)_

## Superseded session context

_(Optional: point to the previous goal/board record so history is preserved without rewriting it.)_
